%%{init: {'theme': 'neutral', 'themeVariables': {'fontFamily': 'Inter, system-ui', 'lineWidth': '2'}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Executor as PipelineExecutor
    participant Writer as BronzeWriter
    participant Lock as LockPort
    participant Compressor as zstd Compressor
    participant Storage as Local FS
    participant Lineage as LineageLog
    participant Metrics as MetricsPort

    Note over Executor,Writer: Phase 1: Prepare Batch

    Executor->>Writer: write_batch(records, provider="chembl", entity="activity")
    activate Writer

    Writer->>Writer: Generate batch_id (UUID)
    Writer->>Writer: Validate records (JSON parseable)

    opt require_lock=True
        Writer->>Lock: validate_owner(key, owner_id)
        Lock-->>Writer: True (valid)
    end

    Note over Writer,Storage: Phase 2: Serialize & Compress

    Writer->>Writer: Serialize records to JSONL
    Note right of Writer: One JSON object per line\nUTF-8 encoding

    Writer->>Compressor: compress(jsonl_bytes)
    activate Compressor
    Note right of Compressor: zstd compression\nLevel: 3\nThreads: -1 (auto)
    Compressor-->>Writer: compressed_bytes
    deactivate Compressor

    Note over Writer,Storage: Phase 3: Build Path & Write

    Writer->>Writer: Build path
    Note right of Writer: Path: bronze/v1/{provider}/{entity}/{date}/batch_{batch_id}.jsonl.zst

    Writer->>Storage: write_bytes(path, compressed_bytes)
    activate Storage
    Storage-->>Writer: OK (file written)
    deactivate Storage

    opt save_json=True
        Writer->>Storage: write_bytes(path.json, uncompressed)
        Storage-->>Writer: OK
    end

    Note over Writer,Lineage: Phase 4: Record Lineage

    Writer->>Lineage: record(entry)
    activate Lineage
    Note right of Lineage: LineageLogEntry (batch_id, pipeline, bronze_paths, version)
    Lineage-->>Writer: OK
    deactivate Lineage

    Note over Writer,Metrics: Phase 5: Emit Metrics

    Writer->>Metrics: observe_histogram("bronze_write_duration_ms", duration)
    Writer->>Metrics: increment_counter("bronze_records_written", count)
    Writer->>Metrics: observe_histogram("bronze_batch_size_bytes", size)

    Writer-->>Executor: BronzeWriteResult
    deactivate Writer

    Note over Executor: BronzeWriteResult (path, batch_id, record_count, compressed_size, ratio)

    rect rgb(255, 240, 245)
        Note over Writer,Storage: Error Handling
        Note right of Writer: On failure: log error, raise BronzeWriteError, pipeline handles checkpoint
    end

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note over Writer: Atomicity Guarantee
        Note right of Writer: Write to temp file first, then atomic rename (no partial writes)
    end
